@startuml Strategy_Pattern
scale 2
!theme plain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 32
caption v2.2.1 · 归档格式 v3

title 策略模式 — 压缩与加密模块

abstract class ICompression {
    + compress(input, metadataOut, output) : void
    + decompress(metadata, input, output, originalSize) : void
}

abstract class IEncryption {
    + encrypt(input, output) : void
    + decrypt(input, output) : void
}

class NullCompression {
    + compress(input, metadataOut, output)
    + decompress(metadata, input, output, originalSize)
}

class NullEncryption {
    + encrypt(input, output)
    + decrypt(input, output)
}

class HuffmanCompression <<adapter>> {
    - huffman : unique_ptr~Huffman~
    + HuffmanCompression()
    + compress(input, metadataOut, output)
    + decompress(metadata, input, output, originalSize)
}

class AesEncryption <<adapter>> {
    - aes : Aes
    + AesEncryption(password)
    + encrypt(input, output)
    + decrypt(input, output)
}

class Aes {
    - hAlg : BCRYPT_ALG_HANDLE
    - hKey : BCRYPT_KEY_HANDLE
    - aesKey16Bytes[16] : uint8_t
    - iv[16] : uint8_t
    - ctrBuf : DataBlock
    - ksBuf : DataBlock
    + Aes(aesKey)
    + ~Aes()
    + doAes(mode, inputBuffer, outputBuffer)
    - ctrXor(data, len)
    - hashTo16Bytes(input, output)
    - processDataAes(inputBuffer, mode) : DataBlock
}

class StrategyFactory {
    + {static} createModules(mode, password) : StrategyModules
    + {static} idToMode(id) : CompressionMode
    + {static} modeToId(mode) : CompressStrategy
    + {static} hasEncryption(mode) : bool
}

class StrategyModules <<struct>> {
    + compression : unique_ptr~ICompression~
    + encryption : unique_ptr~IEncryption~
}

class "Y_flib::Runtime\nRuntimeLibrary.h" as RuntimeLibrary {
    + DataBlock : vector~unsigned char~
    + UpSizeOfBuffer : uint32_t
    + MetadataMarker : uint8_t
    + CompressionMode
    + ParserMode
    + AesMode
}

ICompression <|-- NullCompression
ICompression <|-- HuffmanCompression
IEncryption <|-- NullEncryption
IEncryption <|-- AesEncryption

AesEncryption *--> Aes

StrategyFactory ..> StrategyModules : 创建
StrategyModules *--> ICompression
StrategyModules *--> IEncryption

note right of StrategyFactory
  CompressionMode 定义在 RuntimeLibrary.h。
  落盘时 modeToId 把模式映射为 CompressStrategy 字节，
  解压端 idToMode 从归档头 strategy 字段反查，
  穷举校验通过后映射回枚举。
end note

note bottom of RuntimeLibrary
  CompressionMode 取值：
  HuffmanAES = 0，Huffman 压缩加 AES 加密
  HuffmanOnly = 1，仅 Huffman 压缩
  AESOnly = 2，仅 AES 加密
  PackOnly = 3，仅打包
end note

note bottom of StrategyModules
  流水线的读线程与每个工人各自调用 createModules，
  各自持有一份私有模块。Aes 持有 CNG 句柄与复用缓冲，
  Huffman 持有频率表与编码树，都是可变状态。
end note

note bottom of Aes
  AES-128-CTR 流模式，走 Windows CNG 与 AES-NI。
  密钥由 SHA-256 口令取前 16 字节得到。
  密文由 16 字节随机 IV 加密文体组成，
  长度等于明文长度加 16 字节。
  并行单位是 8MB 块，块间 IV 相互独立。
end note

@enduml
